Task: Implement scenario execution and comparison summaries

Summary: Implemented complete scenario execution runner with result tracking and comprehensive comparison summarization.

Files Changed:
- src/innovate/scenario/execution.py (new)
- src/innovate/scenario/summaries.py (new)
- tests/unit/test_scenario_execution.py (new)
- tests/unit/test_scenario_summaries.py (new)

Details:
- ScenarioExecution: Container for scenario results with metadata (seed, model, version, diagnostics)
- ScenarioComparison: Pairwise comparison with ranking, incremental effect, threshold timing, uncertainty
- ScenarioExecutor: Reproducible executor with seeded RNG, supports grid execution
- compute_ranking(): Score-based ranking (final adoption, etc.)
- compute_incremental_effect(): Absolute and relative effect sizes
- compute_threshold_timing(): Time to adoption thresholds
- compute_uncertainty(): Confidence bounds with configurable levels
- summarize_comparison(): Comprehensive metric aggregation
- Full JSON serialization support for reproducibility
- 26 unit tests covering all functions and scenarios

Why: Provides the execution infrastructure for reproducible experiment workflows, enabling deterministic scenario simulations with comprehensive result analysis and comparison.
